{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Desting Clash&quot; is a roguelike deck-building adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the Fatebearer, commanding a diverse array of heroic warriors to fend off waves of monsters, defeating them in turn-based battles using cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myths and Legends:</strong><br>Recruit your champions from myths, legends, and historical figures across the world to hold back the encroaching threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes from Europe, China, Egypt, and other regions\u2014drawn from history and folklore\u2014are reimagined in unique cartoon-style designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/2e953e806f9af9f9907bf0a7101aff07.poster.avif?t=1767685910\" width=1170 height=612 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/2e953e806f9af9f9907bf0a7101aff07.webm?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Building:</strong><br>Assemble your hero squad and crush your enemies with the tactics of Chinese generals, the curses of Egyptian pharaohs, and the divine power of European gods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction's heroes possess unique traits and mechanics\u2014master them to overcome the relentless waves of foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.poster.avif?t=1767685910\" width=1170 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.webm?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.mp4?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong><br>With over 200 cards and a hero equipment system, no two playthroughs will ever be the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.poster.avif?t=1767685910\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.webm?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.mp4?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell cards, equipment cards, and hero upgrades ensure every battle offers fresh and exciting challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/a4452df80a0a14a26f1d97f799051d8a.poster.avif?t=1767685910\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/a4452df80a0a14a26f1d97f799051d8a.webm?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/a4452df80a0a14a26f1d97f799051d8a.mp4?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693140?t=1767685910","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto