 European gods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction's heroes possess unique traits and mechanics\u2014master them to overcome the relentless waves of foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.poster.avif?t=1767685910\" width=1170 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.webm?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.mp4?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong><br>With over 200 cards and a hero equipment system, no two playthroughs will ever be the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.poster.avif?t=1767685910\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.webm?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.mp4?t=1767685910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell cards, equipment cards, and hero upgrades ensure every battle offers fresh and exciting challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/a4452df80a0a14a26f1d97f799051d